 alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263153687465984421986.png/nk_y7vfb6kjj3UoML_s59o3nh3GZHC56j7SUPo-0lD4\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263151766343680654372.png/Aou1ijB0zGpBckCNQOyeqoIUrPmIUo60H82p-x_Nqfs\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263153897181184426570.png/FHXli2shAY28M0AuRHsQU_PCtlgPbiJUphLiG6YS4hs\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263151321747456604957.png/rYkiWb9BJJLsg3NzUWHWV2Nt40sbakgLbEMLxGxDC8Q\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263151535656960389420.png/owYxM0mzuf02mfUk1J_kyp3j_zq9OxuvWeMnE1njJxM\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263154400497664154726.png/uQc1uz8dOx4nzhMqjptrdcKDDiXbg6C_j2s58Y9rOfE\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263153708437504950184.png/vOnmXc8TsJ47e2zrSyVkEOht91GV1J4fzdDiDM3Q4gw\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263152693415936761590.png/PqWbSxmAO0aV3ikdTijst3Q9lJT3N6OuQKLQJ0Ci0Cc\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263151070089216617408.png/0u2G6NqHsIsdswlt0F5etMM733KI0nXx6Qjh7-kI4e8\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263146892562432042618.png/7jEIeTiLsds_Z01PrsCcajml0Yh23srokEOBvpBDgb4\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263149111218176472953.png/AkzGVFk3gQHi6nEZlYifrRcmfL80u7Koa9MmaWvTJmk\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263149568659456430915.png/Mi9jQY4IEa0WP05eN20qAdQn6gy7FPoB7BbIgOwWyIA\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林襄（fb@林襄）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032263147450273792657410.png/m9BftPm4xBG9QfjaMe9j8clyiVxOJk7D-gIYivoCGIo\"/><figcaption>林襄（fb@林襄）</figcaption></figure><p>網友看她留言紛紛爆動，開心嗨喊要二人趕緊結婚去：</p><p>「我拜託兩位繼續放閃，好喜歡」</p><p>「真愛!!!!感覺好事近了」</p><p>「為什麼我看到一片白，太閃了」</p><p>林襄日前接受《TVBS新聞網》專訪，提到拍到素顏和馬傑森在大街上十指緊扣一事，她落落大方表示：</p><figure><img alt=\"馬傑森（Instagram@jak05.15）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143587665027796992186709.jpeg/f92Re06ZX9ErJtN3-eo01dGZ1H8SBg9hWZO1sVmTtbE\"/><figcaption>馬傑森（Instagram@jak05.15）</figcaption></figure><p>對於感情狀態受到矚目，林襄希望大家把關注放在節目上和她的工作表現，「因為這部分我非常努力、非常賣力的去做，希望大家把更多關注放在我的工作上面，感情的事就順其自然。」</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：林襄競技啦啦隊初體驗　練後空翻滿腿瘀青　獲讚「年輕版蔡依林」】5月30日林襄在台灣天母棒球場挑戰開場舞空拋、後空翻成功，後續她分享自己練習過程的側拍影片。（Instagram@95_mizuki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140624145235578880807126.png/Z3yJWjHI_WB8zhVYtKn4nOMesNjI_8I4zSbK6c0myuk\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：林襄競技啦啦隊初體驗　練後空翻滿腿瘀青　獲讚「年輕版蔡依林」】5月30日林襄在台灣天母棒球場挑戰開場舞空拋、後空翻成功，後續她分享自己練習過程的側拍影片。（Instagram@95_mizuki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5月30日林襄在台灣天母棒球場挑戰開場舞空拋、後空翻成功，後續她分享自己練習過程的側拍影片。（Instagram@95_mizuki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140624524392271872571832.png/UdhXVMrBT5NHxtpcjM1kQP6pcqi7oi-ti3ZeMot2XjI\"/><figcaption>5月30日林襄在台灣天母棒球場挑戰開場舞空拋、後空翻成功，後續她分享自己練習過程的側拍影片。（Instagram@95_mizuki）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5月30日林襄在台灣天母棒球場挑戰開場舞空拋、後空翻成功，後續她分享自己練習過程的側拍影片。（Instagram@95_mizuki）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/2026060